+**Text-layer window coverage on the six houses:**
+
+| Set | Readable schedule | Tags on plans | Tags matching the schedule |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 15 | 30 windows | 56 | 48 |
+| 16 | 28 windows | 48 | 36 |
